VALUES (42954, 'tt3417500', NULL, 'Welcome to Irabu''s Office', '空中ブランコ', 'tv', 2009, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g2ywT0f5CBQGAetctsTz1nWKqMm.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6kI6qQZkO7ler4zjLKVlBYwtSSj.jpg', 'Welcome to Irabu''s Office, where you may be greeted by a man in a bear mask, holding a giant needle, who’s ready to cure your ills. Get to know the eccentric Dr. Ichirou Irabu who has a fetish for injections, and a rather strange methodology. Despite his weird approach, Dr. Irabu (who changes his appearance more than Madonna), does succeed in helping each of his patients... eventually.', NULL, NULL, 3.6595, 8.1, 0, 1.02, '2026-11-23 03:03:39', '2026-11-23 03:03:39')
