VALUES (12651, 'tt0100133', NULL, 'Memphis Belle', 'Memphis Belle', 'movie', 1990, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/epsraI4swsSu9Fyefj7vPPhsOHK.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8kVhN0OC5AmdHJJ1BxKCakZhvQO.jpg', 'The "Memphis Belle" is a World War II bomber, piloted by a young crew on dangerous bombing raids into Europe. The crew only have to make one more bombing raid before they have finished their duty and can go home. In the briefing before their last flight, the crew discover that the target for the day is Bremen.', NULL, NULL, 2.7577, 6.76, 0, 10.07, '2026-11-23 03:03:39', '2026-11-23 03:03:39')
