VALUES (8963, 'tt0112740', NULL, 'Crimson Tide', 'Crimson Tide', 'movie', 1995, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/21nqRJ6ofEgVvEl68J4O9V26Xzy.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mjlRoaURNhcW5YmXev8Z4UrV7x6.jpg', 'After the Cold War, a breakaway Russian republic with nuclear warheads becomes a possible worldwide threat. U.S. submarine Capt. Frank Ramsey signs on a relatively green but highly recommended Lt. Cmdr. Ron Hunter to the USS Alabama, which may be the only ship able to stop a possible Armageddon. When Ramsey insists that the Alabama must act aggressively, Hunter, fearing they will start rather than stop a disaster, leads a potential mutiny to stop him.', NULL, NULL, 5.4091, 7.192, 0, 11.045, '2026-11-22 21:01:41', '2026-11-23 03:03:39')
